gives about 7,450 thousand. An 80 percent interval of 6,850 to 8,050 allows roughly +/-600 thousand, covering typical JOLTS volatility and the April spike risk."},{"kind":"forecast","point":7450,"ciLow":6850,"ciHigh":8050}]}
