urce to match the verified official schedule evidence.\",\nsite/src/data/thesis-analyst-live-comparisons.ts:4921:          call: \"Checked Eurostat euro-indicators listing for nearby macro releases and publication schedule context.\",\nsite/src/data/thesis-analyst-live-comparisons.ts:5566:          call: \"Checked the Fiscal Data release calendar page for the September 2026 MTS release schedule and the MTS publication timing note in official MTS PDFs.\",\nsite/src/data/thesis-analyst-live-comparisons.ts:5568:            \"Fetched official Fiscal Data release calendar surface showing Release Calendar, copyright 2026, and the upcoming-data-release schedule; September 2026 Monthly Treasury Statement is scheduled for 2026-10-20, and MTS PDFs state the statement is normally released on the 8th workday after the reporting month.\",\nsite/src/data/thesis-analyst-live-comparisons.ts:6760:          call: \"Checked the Statistics Bureau of Japan CPI release schedule page for the May 2026 Japan CPI release date.\",\nsite/src/data/thesis-analyst-live-comparisons.ts:7430:          call: \"Checked the official CPI release schedule for the June 2026 Tokyo preliminary release date.\",\nsite/src/data/thesis-analyst-live-comparisons.ts:7432:            \"Schedule shows Ku-area of Tokyo preliminary: survey month May 2026 release May 29 and survey month June 2026 release June 26; same schedule line shows Japan May release June 19.\",\nsite/src/data/thesis-analyst-live-comparisons.ts:7597:            \"The official page says fiscal 2026 release schedule was published on 2026-01-30; the survey-results page lists April 2026 monthly Basic Tabulation released on 2026-05-29; e-Stat table 1-a-1 covers major items including Unemployment rate, survey date 2026Apr, update date 2026-05-29, since Jan. 1953.\",\nsite/src/data/thesis-analyst-live-comparisons.ts:7602:          call: \"Checked the Statistics Bureau Labour Force Survey release schedule for the May 2026 reference month.\",\nsite/src/dat