e 80% interval uses about +/-825,000, wider than recent momentum to cover state reporting dispersion and first-print noise: 78,060,000 - 810,000 = 77,250,000 and 78,060,000 + 840,000 = 78,900,000.\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Counter-consideration: if preliminary March captures more retroactive or late-processed enrollment than usual, the print could sit above February despite the broader downward trend; conversely, a cluster of state methodology changes could push the count below the interval.\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Outside-the-interval scenarios: below 77,250,000 would likely require unusually broad renewal-related terminations or a reporting break; above 78,900,000 would likely require a material state resubmission effect or a broad March enrollment rebound.\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"forecast\\\",\\\"point\\\":78060000,\\\"ciLow\\\":77250000,\\\"ciHigh\\\":78900000}]}\\nrecords/thesis-analyst/2026-06-27/2026-06-27t12-54-48z-statcan-gdp-by-industry-monthly-growth-2026-04/manifest.json:106:    \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Draft is mostly publishable, but the resolver URL/tie-break and a Jan 2026 context inconsistency need correction before publication.\\\"\\nrecords/thesis-analyst/2026-06-27/2026-06-27t13-21-11z-cms-medicaid-chip-total-enrollment-march-2026-fixed-vintage-march-2026-fixed-vintage/draft_codex_stdout.jsonl:6:{\\\"type\\\":\\\"item.completed\\\",\\\"item\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"item_1\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"web_search\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"ws_0856b5b0f0d4a806016a3fce4f03a88195a43de05cf41f2e0b\\\",\\\"query\\\":\\\"site:medicaid.gov enrollment data March 2026 Medicaid CHIP total enrollment release calendar\\\",\\\"action\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"search\\\",\\\"query\\\":\\\"site:medicaid.gov enrollment data March 2026 Medicaid CHIP total enrollment release calendar\\\",\\\"queries\\\":[\\\"site:medicaid.gov enrollment data March 2026 Medicaid CHIP total enrollment release calendar\\\",\\\"CMS Medicaid CHIP Enrollment Data March 20